/* 12章主线《潮汐与雾月之蚀》与6条跨区域搜集支线 / 零副本·全差分 */

:: MP Main Story Eclipse Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">>
<<effects>>
<<set _stg to ($mpMainStoryEclipse or 0)>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Orphanage")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Orphanage">>
<</if>>

<<if _stg is 0>>
	高街与孤儿院交界的石墙下，你循着那枚新近刻下的新月水波纹记号摸索过去，在松动的基石后方翻出了半页被扯下的孤儿院早年收养账册。纸页边缘盖着一枚带有钟摆与海浪图案的暗章，背面用铅笔写着高街钟表旧货铺的门牌与一组微缩音筒编号。
	<<mpAmbient>><<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨声掩去了响动。<<else>>四周静谧无声。<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[核对孤儿院旧账册与钟表铺音筒编号 (0:14)|MP Main Story Eclipse Resolve]]>><<set $mpMainStoryEclipse to 1>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpMainStoryEclipse to 1>><<pass 14>><<stress -6>><<willpower 2>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("main_eclipse_ch_1")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>><</if>><</link>><<lstress>><<gwillpower>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if _stg is 1>>
	你带着账册残页来到高街钟表铺后巷的检修井旁，顺着编号在排风栅格内侧找到了一枚密封的黄铜密文音筒。当你将音筒放在耳畔转动时，齿轮拨片打出的节拍与牛津街旧学园天文翼楼的星象刻度完全吻合。
	<<mpAmbient>><<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜深无人察觉。<<else>>光线照亮了纹理。<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[破译黄铜音筒上的星象刻度 (0:18)|MP Main Story Eclipse Resolve]]>><<set $mpMainStoryEclipse to 2>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpMainStoryEclipse to 1>><<pass 18>><<stress -6>><<willpower 2>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("main_eclipse_ch_2")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>><</if>><</link>><<lstress>><<gwillpower>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if _stg is 2>>
	夜幕低垂时，你潜入牛津街旧学园天文翼楼的折光穹顶室，将黄铜音筒嵌入古老赤道仪的校准槽内。透过镜片折射出的星光在星图档案室的地板上投射出一道坐标，清晰地指向了圣堂地下古修道院的灰烬藏经阁。
	<<mpAmbient>><<if ($stress or 0) gte 3500>>你深呼吸稳住心神。<<else>>你全神贯注地观察。<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[利用赤道仪折射星光定位修道院坐标 (0:22)|MP Main Story Eclipse Resolve]]>><<set $mpMainStoryEclipse to 3>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpMainStoryEclipse to 1>><<pass 22>><<stress -6>><<willpower 2>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("main_eclipse_ch_3")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>><</if>><</link>><<lstress>><<gwillpower>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if _stg is 3>>
	你顺着神殿后方的古老旋梯下到圣堂地下古修道院。在灰烬藏经阁的残碑后方，你拓下了一段百年前『雾月结社』留下的碑文——上面记载着他们每隔十年便会在多瑙河秘密温室庄园举行一次决定小镇资金暗流的午夜集会。
	<<mpAmbient>><<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨声掩去了响动。<<else>>四周静谧无声。<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[拓印修道院残碑上的雾月结社记录 (0:16)|MP Main Story Eclipse Resolve]]>><<set $mpMainStoryEclipse to 4>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpMainStoryEclipse to 1>><<pass 16>><<stress -6>><<willpower 2>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("main_eclipse_ch_4")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>><</if>><</link>><<lstress>><<gwillpower>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if _stg is 4>>
	借着夜雾的掩护，你从冬青树篱的小门潜入多瑙河秘密温室庄园。在雾化兰花厅的玻璃穹顶下，你截获了一份刚刚签署的密件：一批关乎孤儿院地契与旧港控制权的铅封暗箱，正准备通过麋鹿街黑铁货运站的装甲货车连夜转运。
	<<mpAmbient>><<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜深无人察觉。<<else>>光线照亮了纹理。<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[在雾化兰花厅截获转运密件 (0:20)|MP Main Story Eclipse Resolve]]>><<set $mpMainStoryEclipse to 5>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpMainStoryEclipse to 1>><<pass 20>><<stress -6>><<willpower 2>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("main_eclipse_ch_5")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>><</if>><</link>><<lstress>><<gwillpower>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if _stg is 5>>
	你沿着生锈的铁轨潜入麋鹿街黑铁货运站，在信号塔换班的短短数分钟内撬开了三号装甲货车的侧门。你在密封铁箱夹层里找到了一本完整的早年收养与债券总账，上面提及开启最终金库的信物被存放在深林古德鲁伊石环的月泉下。
	<<mpAmbient>><<if ($stress or 0) gte 3500>>你深呼吸稳住心神。<<else>>你全神贯注地观察。<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[潜入三号装甲货车搜寻铅封总账 (0:25)|MP Main Story Eclipse Resolve]]>><<set $mpMainStoryEclipse to 6>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpMainStoryEclipse to 1>><<pass 25>><<stress -6>><<willpower 2>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("main_eclipse_ch_6")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>><</if>><</link>><<lstress>><<gwillpower>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if _stg is 6>>
	你穿过深林迷雾来到古德鲁伊石环，在月泉祭坛清冽的泉水底部摸到了半枚青铜新月徽章。另一半徽章则被标注为峭壁天鹅绒暗层即将举行的午夜假面拍卖会的压轴拍品。
	<<mpAmbient>><<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨声掩去了响动。<<else>>四周静谧无声。<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[在深林月泉底部寻获半枚新月徽章 (0:19)|MP Main Story Eclipse Resolve]]>><<set $mpMainStoryEclipse to 7>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpMainStoryEclipse to 1>><<pass 19>><<stress -6>><<willpower 2>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("main_eclipse_ch_7")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>><</if>><</link>><<lstress>><<gwillpower>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if _stg is 7>>
	你戴上银丝假面步入峭壁天鹅绒暗层的私人拍卖暗厅，借着灯光转换与声东击西之计，从后台保管匣中取回了另外半枚新月徽章。两半徽章合拢的瞬间，内壁浮现出旧钟塔地下机括城的主阀门深度图。
	<<mpAmbient>><<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜深无人察觉。<<else>>光线照亮了纹理。<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[在天鹅绒假面拍卖厅取回另一半徽章 (0:24)|MP Main Story Eclipse Resolve]]>><<set $mpMainStoryEclipse to 8>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpMainStoryEclipse to 1>><<pass 24>><<stress -6>><<willpower 2>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("main_eclipse_ch_8")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>><</if>><</link>><<lstress>><<gwillpower>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if _stg is 8>>
	你深入旧钟塔地下机括城的蒸汽压力室，将合二为一的新月徽章嵌入青铜主控盘。伴随着低沉轰鸣的齿轮合龙声，封锁地下暗河与外海航道的暗闸彻底升起，露出了通往雾角灯塔岛的秘密航标。
	<<mpAmbient>><<if ($stress or 0) gte 3500>>你深呼吸稳住心神。<<else>>你全神贯注地观察。<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[嵌入新月徽章重启机括城主控齿轮 (0:28)|MP Main Story Eclipse Resolve]]>><<set $mpMainStoryEclipse to 9>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpMainStoryEclipse to 1>><<pass 28>><<stress -6>><<willpower 2>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("main_eclipse_ch_9")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>><</if>><</link>><<lstress>><<gwillpower>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if _stg is 9>>
	你在旧港区与下水道交汇的暗河渡口截断了结社的备用补给船，从船舱里搜出了雾角灯塔岛顶层铜门的开启手轮与航海海图。
	<<mpAmbient>><<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨声掩去了响动。<<else>>四周静谧无声。<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[在暗河渡口截获灯塔顶层铜门手轮 (0:21)|MP Main Story Eclipse Resolve]]>><<set $mpMainStoryEclipse to 10>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpMainStoryEclipse to 1>><<pass 21>><<stress -6>><<willpower 2>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("main_eclipse_ch_10")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>><</if>><</link>><<lstress>><<gwillpower>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if _stg is 10>>
	风暴欲来的黄昏，你解开海礁外侧的木舟划向海雾深处的雾角灯塔岛。穿过断桅沉船滩与海蚀回音廊，你一路拾级而上，站在了灯塔最顶层的青铜大门前。
	<<mpAmbient>><<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜深无人察觉。<<else>>光线照亮了纹理。<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[顶着海风登上雾角灯塔岛顶层 (0:32)|MP Main Story Eclipse Resolve]]>><<set $mpMainStoryEclipse to 11>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpMainStoryEclipse to 1>><<pass 32>><<stress -6>><<willpower 2>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("main_eclipse_ch_11")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>><</if>><</link>><<lstress>><<gwillpower>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if _stg is 11>>
	你转动手轮推开雾角灯塔顶层的青铜大门。在巨大的旋转透镜下，所有关于孤儿院早年地契、古董基金与走私暗网的原始契约尽数陈列在铁柜之中。你将铁证与基金彻底收归己有，用灯塔的光束向全镇宣告了旧日阴霾的终结。
	<<mpAmbient>><<if ($stress or 0) gte 3500>>你深呼吸稳住心神。<<else>>你全神贯注地观察。<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[开启灯塔顶层铁柜迎来最终终局 (0:35)|MP Main Story Eclipse Resolve]]>><<set $mpMainStoryEclipse to 12>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpMainStoryEclipse to 1>><<pass 35>><<stress -6>><<willpower 2>><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("main_eclipse_ch_12")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>><</if>><</link>><<lstress>><<gwillpower>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if _stg gte 12>>
	雾角灯塔的光束在夜海中平稳地旋转着。『潮汐与雾月之蚀』的十二章暗流已由你亲手平息，无论是孤儿院的同伴还是镇上的故交，都因你的壮举而得以安宁。
	<br><br>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[收好线索返回 (0:03)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Main Story Eclipse Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">>
<<effects>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Orphanage")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Orphanage">>
<</if>>
你将『潮汐与雾月之蚀』第 <<print ($mpMainStoryEclipse or 1)>> 章的关键物证收入防水暗袋，在脑海中将钟表铺、天文翼楼、地下修道院与雾角灯塔岛的脉络逐一印证。
<<if ($mpMainStoryEclipse or 0) gte 12>>
	至此，席卷全镇的雾月暗流已被你彻底查明并平息，无论前路如何，你都已牢牢握住了自己的命运。<<stress -15>><<trauma -10>><<control 25>>
<<elseif Time.dayState is "night">>
	夜风吹散了街角的薄雾，你压低衣领悄然退回安全地带。
<<else>>
	街面上人流如织，你收好贴身物证，若无其事地汇入人群之中。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[回顾当前主线进展 (0:03)|MP Main Story Eclipse Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回原处 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Collection Quests Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">>
<<effects>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "High Street")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "High Street">>
<</if>>
你在背光的石龛旁停下脚步，将这段时间在小镇各个隐秘角落搜集到的信物残片一一取出核对。
<br><br>
<<if ($mpFragCrownGear or 0) gte 3 and !$mpDoneCrownGear>>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[拼合三枚『失落王冠的黄铜齿轮』开启机括密匣 (0:16)|MP Collection Resolve CrownGear]]>><<pass 16>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	失落王冠的黄铜齿轮：已搜集 <<print ($mpFragCrownGear or 0)>> / 3 枚，散落于旧钟塔地下机括城与学园天文翼楼。
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if ($mpFragAbyssPage or 0) gte 3 and !$mpDoneAbyssPage>>
	<<templeicon>><<link [[拼合三张『深渊古教团的羊皮残页』解读古祝祷 (0:18)|MP Collection Resolve AbyssPage]]>><<pass 18>><</link>>
